# PR Target Guard

## Repository lock
- This repository is personal and PRs must target `felipeblassioli/agent-skills`.
- Never open PRs against `vercel-labs/*` or any upstream repository.

## Required command pattern
Always pass `--repo felipeblassioli/agent-skills` when using GitHub CLI:

```bash
gh pr create --repo felipeblassioli/agent-skills --base main ...
gh pr edit <NUMBER> --repo felipeblassioli/agent-skills ...
gh pr view <NUMBER> --repo felipeblassioli/agent-skills ...
```

## Preflight check before PR creation
Run and verify repo context before any `gh pr create` command:

```bash
gh repo view --json nameWithOwner -q .nameWithOwner
```

Expected output: `felipeblassioli/agent-skills`

If output differs, stop and fix command flags before proceeding.
